: '53s'}]}}\n\nOutputs\nUser successfully signs in with the new password\nConfirmation email received at the registered address\n✅ No helpdesk ticket required\nFAQs\nQ: What if I don't receive the verification code?\nCheck your spam folder and wait two minutes before requesting a resend. If it still doesn't arrive, contact [IT Support](https://support.microsoft.com/contactus).\nQ: What if I no longer have access to my registered phone or backup email?\nSelf-service reset isn't possible without a verification channel. Open a ticket with IT Support so they can verify your identity manually.\n\n## LINKED REFERENCE KNOWLEDGE (Scraped from embedded SOP URLs):\n### Reference Web Page [https://support.microsoft.com/en-US/accounts-billing/manage/reset-a-forgotten-microsoft-account-password]:\nSkip to main content\n\n[![](https://uhf.microsoft.com/images/microsoft/RE1Mu3b.png)\nMicrosoft](https://www.microsoft.com)\n\nSupport\n\n[Support](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us)\n\nSupport\n\n* [Home](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us)\n* [Microsoft 365](https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365?ocid=cmmttvzgpuy)\n* [Office](https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/microsoft-office?ocid=cmml7tr0rib)\n* Products\n  + [Microsoft 365](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/)\n  + [Outlook](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/outlook/)\n  + [Microsoft Teams](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/teams/)\n  + [OneDrive](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/onedrive/)\n  + [Microsoft Copilot](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot/)\n  + [OneNote](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/onenote/)\n  + [Windows](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/)\n  + [more ...](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/all-products-list)\n* Devices\n  + [Surface](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/surface/)\n  + [PC Accessories](https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/surface/accessories/pc/)\n  + [Xbox](https://support.xbox.com/)\n  + [PC Gaming](https://support.xbox.com/help/game